* A real power beats a constant past an explicit threshold: B <_ ( U ^c G ) as soon as ( B ^c ( 1 / G ) ) <_ U (the explicit-threshold form of Mathlib's tendsto_rpow_atTop, used by star_boundW and eventually_uW).

